    text: "Affected stops:\r\nMarket St & 14th St (#21374) (eastbound)\r\nMarket St & 16th Street (#17756) (eastbound)\r\n17th St & Lawrence St (#17717) (eastbound)\r\n17th St & Arapahoe St [ Y Stop ] (#17716) (eastbound)\r\nStout St & 18th St (#17761) (eastbound)\r\nStout St & 19th St (#17762) (eastbound)\r\nCalifornia St & 19th St (#17732) (westbound)\r\nCalifornia St & 17th St (#17733) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Stout St [ Y Stop ] (#17703) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Larimer St (#17707) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 43 get on/off buses at:\r\n11th St & Auraria Pkwy (#34970)\r\nStout St & 21st St (#16660)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 43 get on/off buses at:\r\nCalifornia St & 21st St (#12651)\r\nLarimer St & 12th St (#35474)"
